  "runReferencesOracle": "013/BAT082..089: immutable4boolean/3flag OR/inconsistent-empty rejection; realPG reads and fixed UUID/cutoff; explicit read-write READ COMMITTED, own DB advisory required; all16 independently counted JDBC calls including all4 NULL columns and both close failures, missing/duplicate/null resource reject after closure. Initial/final interrupt retained, unknown runtime/NPE not normal, connection ownership/config untouched, fresh rollback and separate-owner concurrent connections. Observation alone never authorizes GC or substitutes for parent lock continuity.",
  "retirementIoFaultPositions": 6768,
